Package: covearchive
Version: @VERSION@
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Cove <noreply@covearchive.invalid>
Homepage: https://github.com/Sin213/CoveArchive
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.35), libdbus-1-3, libgl1, libegl1, libopengl0, libfontconfig1, libfreetype6, libx11-6, libx11-xcb1, libxext6, libxrender1, libxi6, libsm6, libice6, libxkbcommon0, libxkbcommon-x11-0, libxcb1, libxcb-cursor0, libxcb-icccm4, libxcb-image0, libxcb-keysyms1, libxcb-randr0, libxcb-render0, libxcb-render-util0, libxcb-shape0, libxcb-shm0, libxcb-sync1, libxcb-util1, libxcb-xfixes0, libxcb-xinerama0, libxcb-xinput0, libxcb-xkb1, libwayland-client0, libwayland-cursor0, libwayland-egl1, libglib2.0-0, libgssapi-krb5-2, libssl3, zlib1g
Recommends: git
Description: Local preservation of public project releases
 Browse and archive public GitHub, Codeberg and GitLab.com release assets,
 with a persistent queue, SHA-256 verification and optional Git history.
